    "sub_ename": "SEEING THE WORLD FROM THE PERSPECTIVE OF SPACE",
    "describe_ch": "藉由此課程讓學生了解國內外UAV技術的應用與發展，並且透過簡易型UAV飛行模擬器的練習，讓學生實際體驗UAV技術與操作。",
    "describe_eh": "To understand the domestic UAV technology and development in Taiwan or other countries. And Teach the UAV through Simple assembly and flight simulator exercises. In the course, Students can obtain the actually experience UAV technology and operations.",
